                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "DISCLAIMER: This has been posted roughly 24 hours after its official release. Future updates to come could fix all of this, but at the moment, I'm seeing these issues.\n\nI think this game is missing a lot just in basic mechanics. Doesn't open up half the time, I fell through the menu screen once, and there is no way of pausing it whatsoever. Call me nit-picky, sure, but I think at least two of those aren't too much to ask for.\n\nHowever, this is still a great concept, and, if patched up and done right, can make a great game. Not hitting the refund button just yet, but let's hope I don't have to.",
